Name:Scared Werewolf
Desc:The Scared Werewolf wakes up with the other wolves and chooses a target to attack with them. The first time the Scared Wolf is attacked, the Scared Werewolf will instead evade the attack and won't die. The Host should make sure to be aware of which player is the Scared Werewolf.
